                      </chunks>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="param_input" index="8">
                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Upwind terrain class from the revised Davenport roughness classification (Davenport 1960; Wieringa 1992; Davenport, Grimmond, Oke &amp; Wieringa 2000): 1 Sea 0.0002 m · 2 Smooth 0.005 m · 3 Open 0.03 m · 4 Roughly open 0.1 m · 5 Rough 0.25 m · 6 Very rough 0.5 m · 7 Skimming 1 m · 8 Chaotic 2 m. Picking a class sets the roughness length z0 from the table (shown on the banner); Custom uses the Roughness Length input instead. Describe the terrain the wind CROSSES upwind of the site, not the site itself.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">bd055c65-26a4-4f1c-a3bf-1f02e7d8e76c</item>
                        <item name="Multiple" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Terrain Type</item>
                        <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Terrain Type</item>
                        <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="Options" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Custom (z0 input)
1 — Sea (0.0002 m)
2 — Smooth (0.005 m)
3 — Open (0.03 m)
4 — Roughly open (0.1 m)
5 — Rough (0.25 m)
6 — Very rough (0.5 m)
7 — Skimming (1 m)
8 — Chaotic (2 m)
EN 1991-1-4 cat. 0 (0.003 m)
EN 1991-1-4 cat. I (0.01 m)
EN 1991-1-4 cat. II (0.05 m)
EN 1991-1-4 cat. III (0.3 m)
EN 1991-1-4 cat. IV (1 m)
ASCE 7 exposure D (0.005 m)
ASCE 7 exposure C (0.02 m)
ASCE 7 exposure B (0.3 m)</item>
                        <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="Value" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Custom (z0 input)</item>
                      </items>
                      <chunks count="2">
                        <chunk name="Attributes">
                          <items count="2">
