                    <chunk name="param_input" index="11">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Site latitude (degrees) for a Harris &amp; Deaves inlet — its Coriolis parameter sets the gradient height. Optional: a Wind Conditions record on Wind Directions supplies its site's latitude, and with neither the City of London's 51.51° is used (and said). The profile is weakly sensitive to it: 10° moves U at 100 m by about 1 %. Ignored by the log law.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">b66cd8a8-7780-4929-bb5f-7ed7b0027786</item>
