                    <chunk name="param_input" index="7">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Run FluidX3D as a LIVE SERVER: after voxelising, the solver keeps running until stopped and streams one horizontal wind-speed slice (at Live Height) into a memory-mapped file that FluidX3D Live View (Source = Live server) repaints several times a second. A changed Buildings mesh on Live View is re-voxelised in place — the flow continues, no restart. No VTK frames are written in this mode (Sim Time and Export Interval are not used); stop it from LBM Run's menu.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">fbb8e826-9934-4515-8a80-e93422344044</item>
